  signatureEvery: 3
  mechanic: 1
  description: 'By day she is a quiet neighbor. By night her body splits in two,
    and her wings carry her over the rooftops in search of a victim. Salt on the
    lower half keeps her from ever becoming whole again. While she flies, short words
    barely hurt her: spell long ones, or wait until she splits apart.'
